{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想鞏固乘法表又不想死記硬背，這款《Times Table Time Trial》以計時挑戰方式讓每次練習更有目標。由 1 × 1 至 20 × 20 的乘數表均可選擇，答題後會按速度給予 0 至 100 級評分，適合學生、家長及希望提升心算速度的讀者。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-38.webp\">\n<h2>專注練習與進度紀錄</h2>\n<p>每次挑戰會把所選乘數表的題目隨機出現一次，答錯須留在同一題，避免漏掉算式。畫面提供大型數字鍵盤與安靜計時器，離開 App 時會暫停；完成後按速度獲得等級，打破最佳時間或等級會有彩紙效果。各乘數表尺寸的最佳時間會分別保存，支援淺色與深色模式，且無廣告、無需帳戶，資料只留在 iPhone，亦可離線使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-67-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-68-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-69-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-70-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-71-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Times Table Time Trial</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:04:58.645751+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:51:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:37:43.907177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:58:08.517396+00:00","content_hash":"3da8183b97dd4fe332c533c31b23000a1d16e272a4b2f5fca72bc981b509d38e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}